"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-048","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang-ws2085142"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015","text":"三年春正月，諸葛誕殺文欽。三月，司馬文王克壽春，誕及左右戰死，將吏已下皆降。秋七月，封故齊王奮爲章安侯。詔州郡伐宮材。自八月沈陰不雨四十餘日。亮以綝專恣，與太常全尚，將軍劉丞謀誅綝。九月戊午，綝以兵取尚，遣弟恩攻殺丞於蒼龍門外，召大臣會宮門，黜亮爲會稽王，時年十六。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":30,"last_line":30,"raw_start":2425,"raw_end":2565,"raw_character_offsets":[2432,2433,2434,2435,2436,2437,2438,2439,2440,2441,2442,2443,2444,2445,2446,2447,2448,2449,2450,2451,2452,2453,2454,2455,2456,2457,2458,2459,2460,2461,2462,2463,2464,2465,2466,2467,2468,2469,2470,2471,2472,2473,2474,2475,2476,2477,2478,2479,2480,2481,2482,2483,2484,2485,2486,2487,2488,2489,2490,2491,2492,2493,2494,2495,2496,2497,2498,2499,2500,2501,2502,2503,2504,2505,2506,2507,2508,2509,2510,2511,2512,2513,2514,2515,2516,2517,2518,2519,2520,2521,2522,2523,2524,2525,2526,2527,2528,2529,2530,2531,2532,2533,2534,2535,2536,2537,2538,2539,2540,2541,2542,2543,2544,2545,2546,2547,2548,2549,2550,2551,2552,2553,2554,2555,2556,2557,2558,2559,2560,2561,2562,2563,2564],"revision_id":2085142},"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0043","surface":"故齊王奮","start":43,"end":47,"kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_E","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0071","surface":"亮","start":71,"end":72,"kind":"person","person_id":"hqp_o1w_ihy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0073","surface":"綝","start":73,"end":74,"kind":"person","person_id":"hzw_vox_wvw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0080","surface":"全尚","start":80,"end":82,"kind":"person","person_id":"vl3_bta_0h1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0085","surface":"劉丞","start":85,"end":87,"kind":"person","person_id":"tl2_75k_tjd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0089","surface":"綝","start":89,"end":90,"kind":"person","person_id":"hzw_vox_wvw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0096","surface":"綝","start":96,"end":97,"kind":"person","person_id":"hzw_vox_wvw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0104","surface":"恩","start":104,"end":105,"kind":"person","person_id":"dpj_he6_heq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang:p015:m0122","surface":"亮","start":122,"end":123,"kind":"person","person_id":"hqp_o1w_ihy","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-048","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-048-sun-liang-ws2085142"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-064-suncong-complete:p001","text":"　　孫綝字子通，與峻同祖。綝父綽為安民都尉。綝始為偏將軍，及峻死，為待中武衛將軍，領中外諸軍事，代知朝政。呂據聞之大恐，與諸督將連名，共表薦滕胤為丞相，綝以胤為大司馬，代呂岱駐武昌。據引兵還，使人報胤，欲共廢綝。綝聞之，遣從兄慮將兵逆據於江都，使中使敕文欽、劉纂、唐諮等合眾擊據，遣侍中左將軍華融、中書丞丁晏告胤取據，並喻胤宜速去意，胤自以禍及，因留融、晏，勒兵自衛，召典軍揚崇、將軍孫諮，告以綝為亂，迫融等使有書難綝。綝不聽，表言胤反，許將軍劉丞以封爵，使率兵騎急攻圍胤。胤又劫融等使詐詔發兵。融等不從，胤皆殺之。胤顏色不變，談笑若常。或勸胤引兵至蒼龍門，「將士見公出，必皆委綝就公」。時夜已半，胤恃與據期。又難舉兵向富，乃約令部曲，說呂侯以在近道，故皆為胤盡死，無離散者。時大風，比曉，據不至。綝兵大會，遂殺及將士數十人，夷胤三族。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":78,"last_line":78,"raw_start":10365,"raw_end":10949,"raw_character_offsets":[10365,10366,10367,10368,10369,10370,10371,10372,10373,10374,10375,10376,10377,10378,10379,10380,10381,10382,10383,10384,10385,10386,10387,10388,10389,10390,10391,10392,10393,10394,10395,10396,10397,10398,10399,10400,10401,10402,10403,10404,10405,10406,10407,10408,10409,10410,10411,10412,10413,10414,10415,10416,10417,10418,10419,10420,10421,10422,10423,10424,10425,10426,10427,10428,10429,10430,10431,10432,10433,10434,10435,10436,10437,10438,10439,10440,10441,10442,10443,10444,10445,10446,10447,10448,10449,10450,10451,10452,10453,10454,10455,10456,10457,10458,10459,10460,10461,10462,10463,10464,10465,10466,10467,10468,10469,10470,10471,10472